<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Xray Vision</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 17, up to 50%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast xray vision &lt;someone or something&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cast xray vision chest
</pre>
<p>The caster covers their right eye and utters 'Oculo ento', and sees 
straight through someone or something here: a list of all it contains. 
Look into a locked chest without opening it, or into a stranger's pack, 
and see everything they carry and wear.
</p><p>The one you look into resists with their mind; if the spell fails, you 
see nothing. Things buried away stay hidden. It doesn't work on yourself: 
use <a cmd='#'>inventory</a>. You must be standing. It is also found on potions and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sorcerer Spells</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Look</a>
</pre>




</div>